{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["הִתְפָּאֵר — exalt yourself over me to seek your desire and I will do it. As in: (Judges 7:2) יִתְפָּאֵר עָלַי יִשְׂרָאֵל לֵאמֹר יָדִי הוֹשִׁיעָה לִי." "For when shall I entreat for you — for which day and time do you want all the frogs to disappear? And I will entreat immediately that they die, up to that time that you request of me, for it is not the way for them all to die at once."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:46.586550489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}